OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 2 DEC
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: John Rutter
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod speaks to John
OL,6,     GRutter about his extraordinary
OL,7,     Gmusical career in his 80th
OL,8,     Gbirthday year. Today, John talks
OL,9,     Gabout his love of Cambridge,
OL,10,     Gwhere he got his big break.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GLive music from BBC Young
OL,13,     GMusician, Ryan Wang, plus
OL,14,     Gconductor Jeanette Sorrell.
OL,15,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,16,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
