OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 2 DEC
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GNil Venditti conducts Royal
OL,6,     GNorthern Sinfonia in Beethoven's
OL,7,     Giconic Symphony No. 5, and Boris
OL,8,     GGiltburg is the soloist in
OL,9,     GChopin's Piano Concerto No. 2.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: Electronic Women
OL,11,     GHannah Peel delves into the
OL,12,     Gsounds and stories of 5 female
OL,13,     Gelectronic pioneers. Tonight
OL,14,     GDelia Derbyshire a creator close
OL,15,     Gto Hannah's heart who brought the
OL,16,     Gtheme from Dr Who to life.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
